[{"title":"渡扬子江","author":"金和","text":"遥指江城路，乡关物候新。\n桃花千尺浪，杨柳万家春。\n湖海嗟行客，诗书励此身。\n伯兮同击楫，莫漫怅风尘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18994,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"由江阴乘舟抵里门喜赋","author":"金和","text":"听到乡音熟，沿途减客愁。\n田园认游子，风雨送归舟。\n浩劫怀前度，炎州记昔游。\n舜过岩畔路，云水自悠悠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18995,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江城愁感","author":"金和","text":"书馆添幽趣，山光雨后佳。\n夕阳明耀塔，秋月冷空斋。\n流水高人调，乘风壮士怀。\n不堪萧瑟感，风露立閒阶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18996,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"仲冬送心兰四兄赴粤二首 其一","author":"金和","text":"风雪岁云暮，胡为尚远行。\n惯抛游子泪，长系故乡情。\n万里度梅岭，三年客穗城。\n离筵今夕酒，先是问归程。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18997,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"仲冬送心兰四兄赴粤二首 其二","author":"金和","text":"屈指经行处，长亭复短亭。\n关山增阅历，身世感飘零。\n才返鄱湖棹，重浮粤海萍。\n匆匆挥手去，骊唱不堪听。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18998,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"广州感怀","author":"金和","text":"羊去当年不复回，模糊难访越王台。\n空池寂寞留仙迹，舞榭荒凉慨霸才。\n文字有灵差不朽，云山无恙好重来。\n行人莫问兴亡事，且饮珠江酒一杯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":18999,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"仲冬六日随家大人抵赤溪直隶厅任，恭步祖父大人原韵","author":"金和","text":"乘槎壮志漫思齐，鹏自高骞凤自栖。\n万里波涛浮粤海，一州风月忆云溪。\n荒城小聚鱼虾市，喜雨初滋薯蓣畦。\n东郡趋庭多乐事，鸾笺象管试新题。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19000,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题谢孝子东纬先生侍疾图","author":"沈子玖","text":"人生至性坚金石，忠孝心源磅礴积。\n谢家奕叶绍箕裘，笃厚流光绵世泽。\n先生艺苑夙流芳，庆溢兰陔喜气长。\n方幸春晖绵爱日，斑衣舞綵晋霞觞。\n萱闱翠幔添寒色，悫慎护持尽心力。\n愿以精诚格彼苍，香焚午夜愁如织。\n沈沈卧病几经秋，汤药评量未稍休。\n秋蟀春鹒忙里过，牧羝人落节旄头。\n虞山章子工六法，惨淡经营神理洽。\n好事流传入禁中，九重丹诏传来霎。\n噫吁嘻，年来孝行久沉沦，骨肉相逢等路人。\n读公此图省公意，好垂矩范仰千春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19001,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题谢孝子东纬先生侍疾图","author":"张浚佳","text":"劫井灰飞天地晦，用夷变夏纲常悖。\n父子平等染欧风，礼义廉耻四维废。\n芙蓉城是古暨阳，中有谢氏世流芳。\n绵绵瓜瓞守勿替，先人遗迹人争藏。\n个中往事分明在，北堂供奉毋敢怠。\n母病形骸子病神，目不交睫十八载。\n谁欤绘者虞山章，丹青易代发幽光。\n即金披图肃然起，我欲为之歌陟屺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19002,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寿少泉从兄七十 其一","author":"张浚佳","text":"一曲新歌记事详，归来沧海布帆张。\n兰成正感梨桃熟，陶令翻缘松菊忙。\n防俗客来迂竹径，仿随园意筑山房。\n季鹰风味莼鲈好，淞水优游岁月长。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19003,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寿少泉从兄七十 其二","author":"张浚佳","text":"英英年少露锋芒，不藉科名压众芳。\n秋水文章原不染，春风桃李尽成行。\n王侯适馆虚前席，宰相传经列后堂。\n人爵何如天爵贵，岿然共仰鲁灵光。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19004,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题赵焕文茂才殉节纪 其一","author":"张浚佳","text":"共和创自楚江边，殉节沙洲有隐贤。\n殷士裸将孤竹死，伤心绝食首阳巅。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19005,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题赵焕文茂才殉节纪 其二","author":"张浚佳","text":"独留正气动乾坤，虽死犹生节义存。\n漫说弹冠非贡禹，青衿一领亦君恩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19006,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雪里桃花二首 其一","author":"沈珂","text":"本是瑶池天上种，无端轻薄被人猜。\n从今一洗千秋恨，也抱冰心傲雪开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19007,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雪里桃花二首 其二","author":"沈珂","text":"数株映雪影横斜，衬出嫣红绿叶遮。\n画谱翻新删旧稿，岁寒图里写桃花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19008,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杨柳","author":"张逸藻","text":"南浦多别离，行人去相续。\n杨柳不知愁，春风依旧绿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19009,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜","author":"张逸藻","text":"残灯摇瘦影，冷雨掩重楼。\n为有还家梦，翻添一段愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19010,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岸柳","author":"张逸藻","text":"千丝万缕不胜娇，空向风前舞楚腰。\n寂寂小桥人不到，和烟和雨弄春潮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19011,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"惜花","author":"沈蓉芬","text":"枉说留春强赋诗，澹云漠漠雨丝丝。\n凭栏莫怨东风恶，早向开时计谢时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19012,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感怀","author":"沈蓉芬","text":"眼前身世几沧桑，细数萍因未忍忘。\n往事何须更回首，易催华鬓上秋霜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19013,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"悼亡女二首 其一","author":"沈蓉芬","text":"折钗曾记断肠时，花谢香消意转痴。\n精卫未忘填海恨，女娲空繫补天思。\n言从永别难为述，病到求生更不支。\n从此绿窗书帖冷，频年悔教苦吟诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19014,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"悼亡女二首 其二","author":"沈蓉芬","text":"一别瑶台晓露清，何年重见许飞琼。\n珠沉碧海冤难雪，玉碎荆山恨未平。\n残月落花如梦令，夕阳芳草可怜生。\n阑干数遍韶华尽，知否孀帏泪暗倾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19015,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江滨晚步","author":"沈蓉芬","text":"渡头滟滟落潮痕，泛尽萍根复蓼根。\n海燕低迷半江雨，归鸿嘹唳独家村。\n求鱼看下澄潭网，乞火频敲隔院门。\n料得天涯摇落处，欲将幽怨寄王孙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19016,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋思","author":"沈蓉芬","text":"花阴满地影纤纤，夜静风微怯捲帘。\n不为姮娥甘避面，怕催秋恨上眉尖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19017,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"落花","author":"沈蓉芬","text":"断红残紫乍高低，浣尽春痕化雪泥。\n六代铅华秋蝶梦，一林风雨夜乌啼。\n秋闻湘瑟人何在，欲问胡麻路已迷。\n元亮自存松菊径，不须空说武陵溪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19018,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋眺","author":"沈蓉芬","text":"望远启层楼，秋光惊远眸。\n山云低欲暝，江月黯生愁。\n树迥平于草，村孤小若舟。\n寂寥吟兴息，聊许似閒鸥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19019,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟行即事","author":"张珊英","text":"一片绿阴里，轻舟荡碧波。\n林梢斜日淡，山半白云多。\n远浦渔师唱，遥岑樵子歌。\n最怜明月上，双桨镜中过。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19020,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七世族祖青岩公冰雪吟有限雨丝风片，烟波画船作句首，溪西鸡齐啼作韵脚。以其效咏一首","author":"张珊英","text":"雨晴新涨碧前溪，丝柳垂垂日渐西。\n风叶舞馀飞白鹭，片云生处唳天鸡。\n烟迷远浦山如湿，波漾轻舟草正齐。\n尽槛独凭帘半捲，船歌声里暮鸦啼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19021,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后窥园偶成","author":"张珊英","text":"乍看檐溜歇崇朝，曲曲回廊傍小桥。\n岸草萋萋春已尽，池荷脉脉涨难消。\n风回波影依前皱，雨过花容分外娇。\n迢递湿云犹未去，阶前积水渍芭蕉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19022,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦至深山二首 其一","author":"张珊英","text":"一片烟霞里，群峰映碧天。\n轻舟过层壑，飞鸟度前川。\n野草迎春发，山猿傍树眠。\n青松迷古道，系棹竹林边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19023,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦至深山二首 其二","author":"张珊英","text":"曙色催啼鸟，晨霞隐隐红。\n白云笼曲岸，翠柏倚遥峰。\n依约清池月，飘摇远寺钟。\n野花春满地，蜂舞绿阴中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19024,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦至深山又绝句一首","author":"张珊英","text":"点点归鸦带夕曛，晚峰高倚万重云。\n暝烟笼树千层湿，新月垂钩一曲银。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19025,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月夜歌","author":"张珊英","text":"冷月皎皎兮映回廊，白云淡淡兮雁南翔。\n高飞且鸣兮声凄凉，微风渐起兮侵罗裳。\n疏星摇落兮凝清光，却下重帘兮隔严霜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19026,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"不寐","author":"张珊英","text":"不寐更阑后，凉风拂我衣。\n钟鸣残月暗，星隐曙光稀。\n砌下惊虫语，林间乍鸟啼。\n晓来烟雾重，红日影迷离。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19027,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纳凉三首 其一","author":"张珊英","text":"画槛晶帘捲，流萤绕翠桐。\n蜘蛛临螟织，菡萏映堤红。\n花影留池水，钟声带晚风。\n倚栏吹玉笛，月上小桥东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19028,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纳凉三首 其二","author":"张珊英","text":"何处砧声急，遥林杜宇呼。\n笑持垂柳带，争钓碧池鱼。\n竹影飞蝙蝠，桐阴唱蟪蛄。\n凉风吹白露，点点湿轻裾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19029,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纳凉三首 其三","author":"张珊英","text":"明月清如水，苍筤疏影横。\n夕花香鬓薄，玉露葛衣轻。\n网草盈阶嫩，流萤点水明。\n小窗帘半捲，风急咽蝉声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19030,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆先兄二首 其一","author":"张珊英","text":"十年空怅望，泪眼不曾晴。\n盈尺梧桐树，秋来已作声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19031,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆先兄二首 其二","author":"张珊英","text":"秋风摇碧草，寒雁数声悲。\n不忍登高望，凭栏双泪垂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19032,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后泛舟二首 其一","author":"张珊英","text":"岸柳拂清泉，溪花笑客船。\n萍疏风动钓，叶落鸟争蝉。\n秋燕穿篱语，沙鸥贴水眠。\n棹回罗袖薄，晻暧暮云连。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19033,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后泛舟二首 其二","author":"张珊英","text":"双桨摇秋色，渔樵归渐稀。\n彩云凝落日，细浪弄斜晖。\n鸂鶒衔鱼舞，蜻蜒点水飞。\n不知谁氏女，歌扇映秋衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19034,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟次晚眺","author":"张珊英","text":"白露滴秋水，寒星映碧天。\n云深遥积翠，月皎远沈烟。\n野景迎峰出，孤松枕石眠。\n蓬窗帘半捲，何处拂湘弦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19035,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋雨二首 其一","author":"张珊英","text":"凉风帘幕吹，疏雨芭蕉滴。\n莎鸡湿且鸣，芳草萋已碧。\n衰杨欹舞迟，晚蝶寻栖急。\n秋云流不尽，秋景无颜色。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19036,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋雨二首 其二","author":"张珊英","text":"烟锁短篱花，云笼长堤树。\n微风拂袖来，秋燕穿篱去。\n暝色递秋声，桐叶洒秋雨。\n湘帘终日垂，砌下寒螀语。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19037,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"别诸姊妹","author":"张珊英","text":"落日催征棹，相看涕泗流。\n迎风牵翠袂，何日问归舟。\n杜宇岂无意，浮云不自由。\n含情耿不语，肠断下汀洲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19038,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋雨","author":"张珊英","text":"花寒帘不捲，枝冷鸟犹栖。\n蝶倦寻芳翅，荷彫浥露衣。\n石池新涨满，小径湿红稀。\n无事教鹦鹉，閒庭昼掩扉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19039,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病后不得家信","author":"张珊英","text":"强对菱花映绮疏，萧萧短鬓不胜梳。\n望残锦字一行雁，目断秋鳞尺素书。\n小鸟有情犹惜别，落花何事亦黏裾。\n谁怜病客深憔悴，滴尽铜龙午梦馀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19040,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赋得萤远入烟流","author":"张珊英","text":"暑色望中收，遥空积翠浮。\n萤和微月上，烟趁晚星流。\n照水时低影，迎风欲暂留。\n竹林深处好，切莫近帘钩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19041,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海棠分韵得翠字","author":"张珊英","text":"曲阑干外春光媚，雨馀睡起娇如醉。\n罗袖低垂浅淡红，舞裙轻曳玲珑翠。\n羞随桃李斗春光，不向春风洒清泪。\n莺啼燕语总无情，匆匆狼籍东君意。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19042,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"枫","author":"张珊英","text":"遥山锁苍翠，秋色入霜枫。\n已夺霞裳艳，还翻锦帐红。\n背风飞蛱蝶，倚日笑梧桐。\n莫道临江晚，曾移汉殿中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19043,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"芦","author":"张珊英","text":"一夜西风冷，江芦瑟瑟秋。\n雪翻溪鹭失，月动浪花浮。\n烟景迷前渡，疏枝拂钓舟。\n只因怜岁晚，诗思满汀洲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19044,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"不寐","author":"张珊英","text":"万籁长空寂，閒庭独倚阑。\n霜天翻匹练，冷月漾晶盘。\n梦绕乡关远，魂飞古渡寒。\n天涯回首处，愁思白云端。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19045,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乙巳仲秋自题道装小影时年七十","author":"赵同骥","text":"我曾束发受诗书，儒服儒冠忍弃诸。\n我曾腼颜登仕版，朝衣朝冠拜丹墀。\n有笑于予者曰：尔为儒耶儒术迂，尔为官耶官近愚。\n掷尔章服仍作儒，吁嗟乎，毕竟依旧一凡夫。\n尔不见函谷关前骑且驱，青牛背上服何襦。\n又不见吕师炼成九转丹，翩翩鹤氅天风寒。\n尔既为儒亦为官，胡竟学儒流申韩。\n一行作吏愧素餐，今特贬尔红尘外，采尔葫芦醒世丸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19046,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒岳武穆墓","author":"章烜","text":"晨兴泛舟游，朝暾在林杪。\n白露溥未收，禽声破清晓。\n言寻精忠墓，众山争缭绕。\n表柱带潮痕，松楸杂丛筱。\n遐哉古英雄，丹心何皎皎。\n铜驼感荆棘，挥戈期直捣。\n犁庭事不成，虏气已全扫。\n岂非偏安局，犹藉公力保。\n回首北邙山，墟墓知多少。\n珠襦并玉柙，零落竟无考。\n兹坟独巍然，生气淩八表。\n不死在人心，何忧天地槁。\n我来瞻眺间，挥泪拜秋草。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19047,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题沈亭丈画竹二首 其一","author":"章烜","text":"三竿两竿墨画竹，腕底飕飕泻寒绿。\n浑然见竹不见人，满腹烟云起崖谷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19048,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题沈亭丈画竹二首 其二","author":"章烜","text":"枝摇箨脱听有声，笔刀手铁天然成。\n夜来风雨洒窗北，纵横四壁龙蛇行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19049,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟次严陵滩","author":"章烜","text":"秋江遥望势瀰漫，百丈荒堤卧远澜。\n平地拓开三面水，宿云放出几重峦。\n风高鸟爱搏霄易，滩急船怀退步难。\n为有披裘人坐钓，至今五月尚馀寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19050,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题闺秀邹蕊珠慎馀斋诗集二首 其一","author":"章烜","text":"瑶池仙子早骖鸾，剩有诗篇下界看。\n一样春晖慈荫好，拂云新拓碧琅玕。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19051,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题闺秀邹蕊珠慎馀斋诗集二首 其二","author":"章烜","text":"不负龙山此日过，同岑容听广寒歌。\n分明慧业三生在，一瓣心香印大罗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19052,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"重过西安陈吟樵","author":"章烜","text":"昔日别君花欲坠，今日逢君花正媚。\n花开花谢倏三年，共喜音容未憔悴。\n青青草色满长堤，客子天涯路不迷。\n携得瓮头新酿酒，乱香深处听莺啼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19053,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日西湖即景","author":"章烜","text":"独自寻诗趁野晴，断桥南去路平平。\n四分台榭六分水，三面湖山一面城。\n沽酒市藏枫叶暗，打鱼灯逐蓼花明。\n高林忽隔犹回首，指点归途带月行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19054,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题吴慎斋三冬课读图","author":"夏子龄","text":"茂林居士瘦于竹，健骨森森双鬓绿。\n绿云深处筑幽栖，长夜咿唔课儿读。\n人生有子万事足，而况佳儿皎如玉。\n寒窗珍重到三馀，背诵琅琅声绕屋。\n读书妙理无过熟，水泻银瓶风扫箨。\n他年太乙炳青藜，炯炯双眸校天禄。\n始知韦籯薄黄金，肯令韩檠弃墙角。\n诗书贻泽古来长，今日披图为君卜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19055,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晓行","author":"夏子龄","text":"寒铎响零丁，鞭声隔梦听。\n马蹄敲冷月，鸡口落残星。\n未见欃枪扫，何时羽檄停。\n东征诸将士，努力事韬铃。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19056,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春閒得两鹦鹉，翠羽翩跹，双栖并语。虽未能言，颇解人意，夜来忽毙其一，诗以悼之","author":"夏子龄","text":"侧立斜飞入画图，红襟翠袖炯清矑。\n轻身幸未归黄祖，恨事无殊堕绿珠。\n默诵金经先解脱，梦回秦陇恐模糊。\n哀鸣尚有琼轩侣，明月帘栊影自孤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19057,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感赋八首 其一 云秋","author":"缪焕章","text":"杳蔼长空列画屏，轻罗新样织珑玲。\n无心又向遥山出，有梦都随别浦停。\n凤侣高寒千仞碧，雁程迢递一痕青。\n妙鬘绕遍重重树，谁倚楼头认客星。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19058,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感赋八首 其二 月秋","author":"缪焕章","text":"玉宇谁脩七宝成，广寒宫殿俨分明。\n祇怜圆影迟迟上，已有离愁黯黯生。\n画角千山闺里梦，霜砧万户客中情。\n夜阑孤雁声嘹唳，不独凄凉廿五钲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19059,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]